  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sunil Kumar Modanwal vs State Of U.P. And 5 Others on 4 August, 2022 Bench: Manoj Kumar Gupta, Yogendra Kumar Srivastava High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 21 Case :- Writ - C No. - 22117 of 2022 Petitioner :- Sunil Kumar Modanwal",
    "facts": "Although several reliefs have been claimed in the writ petition, but at the time of making oral submission, learned counsel for the petitioner has pressed only relief no. 2, which is for a direction to respondent no. 2 to decide Misc. Appeal No. 15/2021, filed by the petitioner under Section 70 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2007, within a specified time frame. We find that the appeal was filed along with an application under Section 5 of the Limitation Act to condone delay.",
